Tentu, ini adalah **Blueprint Sistem Administrasi Guru (SiGuru)** yang dirancang khusus untuk mengakomodasi logika Kurikulum Merdeka & K13 dengan arsitektur yang scalable dan maintainable.

Sistem ini dirancang menggunakan **PostgreSQL** (Relational DB) dan **Node.js (Express)** dengan pendekatan **Clean Architecture**.

---

### 1. ERD Database (Entity Relationship Diagram)

Berikut adalah entitas utama dan hubungannya:

*   **schools** (1) ──── (N) **teachers**
*   **teachers** (1) ──── (N) **classes** (Wali Kelas)
*   **classes** (1) ──── (N) **students**
*   **subjects** (1) ──── (N) **curriculum_plans** (Mengikat TP & LM)
*   **curriculum_plans** (1) ──── (N) **learning_objectives** (TP - Formatif)
*   **learning_objectives** (1) ──── (N) **learning_materials** (LM - Sumatif)
*   **students** (1) ──── (N) **grades** (Nilai)
*   **schedules** (1) ──── (N) **attendance_sessions**
*   **attendance_sessions** (1) ──── (N) **attendance_records**

**Primary Keys (PK) & Foreign Keys (FK):**
*   Semua tabel menggunakan UUID sebagai PK.
*   Relasi menggunakan `ON DELETE CASCADE` untuk integritas data (misal: hapus siswa, nilai ikut terhapus).

---

### 2. Skema Tabel SQL (PostgreSQL)

```sql
-- Ekstensi UUID
CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS "uuid-ossp";

-- 1. Master Data
CREATE TABLE schools (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    level VARCHAR(10) NOT NULL -- SD, SMP, SMA, SMK
);

CREATE TABLE teachers (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    school_id UUID REFERENCES schools(id),
    email VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    password_hash VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    full_name VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
    nip VARCHAR(50)
);

CREATE TABLE classes (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    teacher_id UUID REFERENCES teachers(id), -- Wali Kelas
    name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL, -- "10-A"
    level VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL, -- "Fase E"
    academic_year VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE students (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    class_id UUID REFERENCES classes(id),
    name VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
    nis VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'Aktif'
);

-- 2. Kurikulum
CREATE TABLE subjects (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    teacher_id UUID REFERENCES teachers(id),
    name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    kktp_score INTEGER DEFAULT 75
);

CREATE TABLE learning_objectives ( -- TP (Untuk Nilai Formatif)
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    subject_id UUID REFERENCES subjects(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    code VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL, -- "TP.1"
    description TEXT NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE learning_materials ( -- LM (Untuk Nilai Sumatif)
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    subject_id UUID REFERENCES subjects(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    code VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL, -- "LM.1"
    topic VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL
);

-- 3. Penilaian
CREATE TABLE grades (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    student_id UUID REFERENCES students(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    subject_id UUID REFERENCES subjects(id),

    -- Tipe Nilai: 'FORMATIF' (link ke TP) atau 'SUMATIF' (link ke LM)
    assessment_type VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL, 
    reference_id UUID NOT NULL, -- Bisa TP_ID atau LM_ID

    score NUMERIC(5,2) NOT NULL,

    UNIQUE(student_id, assessment_type, reference_id) -- Mencegah duplikasi nilai
);

CREATE TABLE attitudes ( -- Nilai Sikap
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    student_id UUID REFERENCES students(id),
    subject_id UUID REFERENCES subjects(id),
    score NUMERIC(5,2),
    UNIQUE(student_id, subject_id)
);

-- 4. Kehadiran
CREATE TABLE attendance_sessions (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    class_id UUID REFERENCES classes(id),
    subject_id UUID REFERENCES subjects(id),
    date DATE NOT NULL,
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE TABLE attendance_records (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    session_id UUID REFERENCES attendance_sessions(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    student_id UUID REFERENCES students(id),
    status VARCHAR(1) NOT NULL, -- H, I, S, A
    notes TEXT
);

-- Indexing untuk performa Query
CREATE INDEX idx_grades_student ON grades(student_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_grades_subject ON grades(subject_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_attendance_date ON attendance_sessions(date);
```

---

### 3. Struktur Folder Project (Modular Monolith)

Menggunakan pendekatan domain-driven design (DDD) ringan agar mudah dikelola.

```text
/backend-siguru
├── src
│   ├── config/             # Database connection, env vars
│   ├── modules/            # MODULAR PER FITUR
│   │   ├── academic/       # Domain: Kelas, Siswa, Jadwal
│   │   │   ├── controllers/
│   │   │   ├── services/
│   │   │   ├── repositories/
│   │   │   └── models/
│   │   ├── grading/        # Domain: Nilai, TP, LM, Kalkulasi
│   │   │   ├── GradingController.ts
│   │   │   ├── GradingService.ts
│   │   │   └── GradingRepository.ts
│   │   └── auth/           # Domain: Login, Profile
│   ├── shared/             # Utils, Middlewares, Helpers
│   │   ├── utils/
│   │   │   └── GradeCalculator.ts  <-- Logic Kalkulasi Terpisah
│   │   └── middlewares/
│   ├── app.ts              # Entry point Express
│   └── routes.ts           # Main router aggregator
└── package.json
```

---

### 4. Daftar API Endpoint (Utama)

| Method | Endpoint | Fungsi | Contoh Payload |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/classes/:classId/students` | Get siswa per kelas | - |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/grading/bulk` | Input nilai matriks (banyak sekaligus) | `[{student_id, ref_id, type, score}, ...]` |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/grading/recap/:classId` | Get rekap nilai + kalkulasi akhir | - |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/attendance` | Simpan presensi harian | `{session_date, records: [{student_id, status}]}` |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/curriculum/objectives` | Get daftar TP & LM untuk header tabel | - |

---

### 5. Contoh Kode Backend (Node.js/Express)

**Model/Interface (Typescript):**
